    "created_at": "2023-11-22T08:28:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-11-22T08:28:22Z",
    "body": "No, it was aspirational. Initially we designed it such that (byte) streams would only emit Uint8Array to consumers. And later we adopted that for the other direction as well. Mainly for consistency I think, but also with some hope that would allow optimizations.\r\n\r\nMost things in the platform that accept buffers should indeed accept BufferSource, but they're not dealing with streams.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
