    "updated_at": "2023-11-22T09:52:09Z",
    "body": "I mean, ReadableByteStreamController accepts ArrayBufferView instead of just Uint8Array: https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-rbs-controller-enqueue (Not BufferSource, hmm.)\r\n\r\nEdit: Based on that I still think \"Emit Uint8Array, receive more broad types\" pattern is used across many specs and thus gives consistency.",
