    "created_at": "2023-11-22T10:02:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-11-22T10:04:21Z",
    "body": "Here is an inconsistency:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n// One can enqueue Uint16Array with type: bytes\r\nawait new Response(new ReadableStream({\r\n  start(c) {\r\n    c.enqueue(new Uint16Array([0xD55C, 0xAE00]));\r\n    c.close();\r\n  },\r\n  type: \"bytes\"\r\n})).blob()\r\n\r\n// But this fails\r\nawait new Response(new ReadableStream({\r\n  start(c) {\r\n    c.enqueue(new Uint16Array([0xD55C, 0xAE00]));\r\n    c.close();\r\n  }\r\n})).blob()\r\n```",
